-- הסכם עוז לתמורה (14.8.2011), נספח ה': the procedure for ending the
-- employment of a permanent teacher by his owner for pedagogical reasons
-- (§49 sends to it) — the year of pedagogical accompaniment, then the
-- dismissal procedure in four stages, and its notes.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT parties
IMPORT vocabulary
IMPORT conventions
IMPORT `oz-founding-common`
IMPORT `oz-founding-19`

§ `נספח ה'`

DECLARE `Oz annex ה action` IS ONE OF
    `let the teacher know his evaluation and his place among his colleagues`
    `tell the teacher of the significant pedagogical faults found`
    `hold professional meetings presenting the faults`
    `present the expectations and the goals, and give the chance to improve`
    `write the meeting's protocol and give the teacher a copy`
    `update the organisation's representative`
    `sum up the accompaniment year and give the teacher the summary`
    `summon the teacher to the stage א meeting`
    `show the teacher the evaluations and the faults not improved`
    `summon the organisation's representative and hear the teacher`
    `set the goals again, with a timetable to measure them`
    `summon the teacher to the second meeting`
    `open the dismissal procedure formally, in writing`
    `give the teacher the full record of the second meeting`
    `set the goals again, and an examination period`
    `coordinate the professional visits`
    `hold a feedback talk after the visit`
    `write a detailed opinion with an explicit recommendation`
    `give the opinion to the supervisor and the principal, and a copy to the teacher`
    `write the summary report with an explicit recommendation`
    `send the summary report to the owner's director-general and the district`
    `summon the teacher and the organisation's representative to a hearing`
    `give the teacher written notice of his dismissal`
    `tell the teacher of a visit`
    `coordinate a change in the procedure with the organisation`

-- akn:att_13__hc_1/p1 The title, "הליך הפסקת עבודה של מורה קבוע בבעלות מטעמים פדגוגיים"; §49 names it and limits it to permanent teachers.

§§ `א. רקע`

-- א.: in the evaluation of teachers by the evaluation model "כהגדרתו בהסכם
-- קיבוצי מתאריך ___" — the date left blank, which the corpus marks and
-- reads as this agreement, whose model §19 sets (oz-founding-19) — the
-- quality of each teacher's teaching is evaluated every year, so that he
-- knows his evaluation and his place among his colleagues. The duty is the
-- school management's, who evaluate under §19; "מדי שנה" gives no day
-- (convention dates.no-deadline).
@ref akn:att_13__hc_1__para_a akn:att_13__hc_1__para_a/p2
`letting the teacher know his evaluation` MEANS
    PARTY `the school management`
    MUST  `let the teacher know his evaluation and his place among his colleagues`

-- Where significant pedagogical faults are found in his work by the model,
-- the procedure below begins.
@ref akn:att_13__hc_1__para_a/p3
GIVEN `significant pedagogical faults found by the evaluation model` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `annex ה's procedure begins` `significant pedagogical faults found by the evaluation model` IF
    `significant pedagogical faults found by the evaluation model`

§§ `ב. ליווי פדגוגי`

-- ב.(1): where significant pedagogical faults were found by the model, the
-- school principal and the subject coordinator (or the pedagogical
-- coordinator) tell the teacher so at the end of the school year before
-- the year of pedagogical accompaniment. A school year y opens on 1.9.y
-- (convention dates.school-year), so the year before the accompaniment
-- year y ends on 31.8.y, the day included (convention dates.end).
@ref akn:att_13__hc_1__para_b akn:att_13__hc_1__para_b__subpara_1
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER @desc the accompaniment year, by the calendar year it opens in
GIVETH A DATE
DECIDE `the day by which the teacher is told of the faults before` y IS
    DATE_FROM_DMY 31 8 y

GIVEN `days from the finding to that day` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `Oz annex ה action`
DECIDE `telling the teacher of the faults` `days from the finding to that day` IS
    PARTY `the school principal`
    MUST  `tell the teacher of the significant pedagogical faults found`
    WITHIN `days from the finding to that day`
    LEST  BREACH BY `the school principal` BECAUSE "נספח ה', ב.(1): the teacher is told of the faults at the end of the school year before the accompaniment year"

-- ב.(2): in the accompaniment year the principal and the subject
-- coordinator hold professional meetings with the teacher, putting to him
-- the faults found; a claim of faults rests on observations of lessons and
-- on written materials, and on nothing else.
@ref akn:att_13__hc_1__para_b__subpara_2
`holding the professional meetings` MEANS
    PARTY `the school principal`
    MUST  `hold professional meetings presenting the faults`

GIVEN `rests on observations of lessons` IS A BOOLEAN, `rests on written materials` IS A BOOLEAN, `rests on anything else` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a claim of faults may be put to the teacher` `rests on observations of lessons` `rests on written materials` `rests on anything else` IF
    (`rests on observations of lessons` OR `rests on written materials`) AND NOT `rests on anything else`

-- ב.(3): in the meetings they present their expectations of his
-- pedagogical work and the goals he is to reach; in the year he is given
-- the chance to improve.
@ref akn:att_13__hc_1__para_b__subpara_3
`presenting the goals` MEANS
    PARTY `the school principal`
    MUST  `present the expectations and the goals, and give the chance to improve`

-- ב.(4): a protocol is written of every meeting, and a copy given to the
-- teacher soon after it ("בסמוך": no day, convention dates.no-deadline).
@ref akn:att_13__hc_1__para_b__subpara_4
`writing the protocols` MEANS
    PARTY `the school principal`
    MUST  `write the meeting's protocol and give the teacher a copy`

-- ב.(5): the principal keeps the organisation's representative updated.
@ref akn:att_13__hc_1__para_b__subpara_5
`updating the organisation's representative` MEANS
    PARTY `the school principal`
    MUST  `update the organisation's representative`

-- ב.(6): at the end of the school year the principal sums up the process,
-- saying whether the teacher met his goals and improved as required, and
-- detailing the faults and the components that did not improve ("the
-- summary"); it is given to the teacher soon after, and in any case before
-- the accompaniment year ends (31.8 of the year after it opened).
@ref akn:att_13__hc_1__para_b__subpara_6 akn:att_13__hc_1__para_b__subpara_6/p2
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER @desc the accompaniment year, by the calendar year it opens in
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `days the principal has for the summary in` y IS
    DATE_SERIAL (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 8 (y PLUS 1)) MINUS DATE_SERIAL (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 y)

GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `Oz annex ה action`
DECIDE `summing up the accompaniment year` y IS
    PARTY `the school principal`
    MUST  `sum up the accompaniment year and give the teacher the summary`
    WITHIN `days the principal has for the summary in` y
    LEST  BREACH BY `the school principal` BECAUSE "נספח ה', ב.(6): the summary is given to the teacher before the accompaniment year ends"

-- The accompaniment year is a school year in which the teacher taught in
-- the school eight months at least, the summer vacation not counted
-- ("לפחות": 8 is in).
@ref akn:att_13__hc_1__para_b/p2
GIVEN `months taught in the school in the year, summer excluded` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a year of pedagogical accompaniment` `months taught in the school in the year, summer excluded` IF
    `months taught in the school in the year, summer excluded` AT LEAST 8

-- Where, at the end of the accompaniment year, the principal decided that
-- the teacher did not meet the goals set him by the summary, and that a
-- pedagogical dismissal procedure is to begin, it begins in the next
-- school year, as part ג sets out.
@ref akn:att_13__hc_1__para_b/p3
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER @desc the accompaniment year, by the calendar year it opens in
      `months taught in the school in the year, summer excluded` IS A NUMBER
      `the principal decided the goals were not met` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the principal decided a dismissal procedure is to begin` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the school year the dismissal procedure begins in` y `months taught in the school in the year, summer excluded` `the principal decided the goals were not met` `the principal decided a dismissal procedure is to begin` IS
    IF      `a year of pedagogical accompaniment` `months taught in the school in the year, summer excluded`
        AND `the principal decided the goals were not met`
        AND `the principal decided a dismissal procedure is to begin`
    THEN JUST (y PLUS 1)
    ELSE NOTHING

-- akn:att_13__hc_1__para_b/p4 The signatures at the foot of the page; no rule.

§§ `ג. הליך הפיטורים — שלב א'`

-- ג., stage א(1): the principal summons the teacher to a meeting held no
-- later than the beginning of October of the school year after the
-- accompaniment year: by 1.10 of that year, the day included (convention
-- dates.end).
@ref akn:att_13__hc_1__para_c akn:att_13__hc_1__para_c__hc_1__subpara_1
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER @desc the school year the procedure begins in, by the calendar year it opens in
GIVETH A DATE
DECIDE `the last day for the stage א meeting in` y IS
    DATE_FROM_DMY 1 10 y

GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `Oz annex ה action`
DECIDE `holding the stage א meeting in` y IS
    PARTY `the school principal`
    MUST  `summon the teacher to the stage א meeting`
    WITHIN DATE_SERIAL (`the last day for the stage א meeting in` y) MINUS DATE_SERIAL (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 y)
    LEST  BREACH BY `the school principal` BECAUSE "נספח ה', ג. שלב א'(1): the meeting is held no later than the beginning of October"

-- Stage א(2): at the meeting the principal shows the teacher the results
-- of the professional evaluations made of him, and the faults found that
-- did not improve in the year before.
@ref akn:att_13__hc_1__para_c__hc_1__subpara_2
`showing the teacher the evaluations` MEANS
    PARTY `the school principal`
    MUST  `show the teacher the evaluations and the faults not improved`

-- Stage א(3): the organisation's representative is summoned to it, and
-- the teacher is given the chance to be heard; if the representative
-- chooses not to take part, it may be held without him.
@ref akn:att_13__hc_1__para_c__hc_1__subpara_3
`summoning the representative to the stage א meeting` MEANS
    PARTY `the school principal`
    MUST  `summon the organisation's representative and hear the teacher`

GIVEN `the representative was summoned` IS A BOOLEAN, `the representative chose not to take part` IS A BOOLEAN, `the representative takes part` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the stage א meeting may be held` `the representative was summoned` `the representative chose not to take part` `the representative takes part` IF
    `the representative was summoned` AND (`the representative takes part` OR `the representative chose not to take part`)

-- Stage א(4): at its end the goals of improvement expected of the teacher
-- are set again, with a timetable to measure the improvement.
@ref akn:att_13__hc_1__para_c__hc_1__subpara_4
`setting the goals again at stage א` MEANS
    PARTY `the school principal`
    MUST  `set the goals again, with a timetable to measure them`

§§ `ג. הליך הפיטורים — שלב ב'`

-- Stage ב: where the teacher did not meet the goals set at stage א, stage
-- ב begins.
@ref akn:att_13__hc_1__para_c__hc_2/p1
GIVEN `met the goals set at stage א` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `stage ב begins` `met the goals set at stage א` IF
    NOT `met the goals set at stage א`

-- Stage ב(1): the principal summons the teacher to a second meeting, by a
-- notice given him a week in advance at least ("לפחות": 7 days are in);
-- the meeting is held after a period "שבין 4-6 שבועות" of teaching, the
-- vacations not counted, from the stage א meeting — both ends in, the text
-- giving both (an exception to convention thresholds.loose); the teacher
-- may invite a representative of the teachers' committee.
@ref akn:att_13__hc_1__para_c__hc_2__subpara_1
`days of notice of the second meeting, at least` MEANS 7

GIVEN `days of notice given` IS A NUMBER, `weeks of teaching since the stage א meeting, vacations excluded` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the second meeting is summoned and held in time` `days of notice given` `weeks of teaching since the stage א meeting, vacations excluded` IF
        `days of notice given` AT LEAST `days of notice of the second meeting, at least`
    AND `weeks of teaching since the stage א meeting, vacations excluded` AT LEAST 4
    AND `weeks of teaching since the stage א meeting, vacations excluded` AT MOST 6

`summoning the teacher to the second meeting` MEANS
    PARTY `the school principal`
    MUST  `summon the teacher to the second meeting`

`the teacher may invite the teachers' committee's representative to the second meeting` MEANS TRUE

-- Stage ב(2): at this meeting the principal tells the teacher of the formal
-- opening of the procedure for ending his employment for pedagogical
-- reasons; the telling is documented in writing by the principal, and the
-- full record is given directly to the teacher soon after the meeting.
@ref akn:att_13__hc_1__para_c__hc_2__subpara_2
`opening the procedure formally` MEANS
    PARTY `the school principal`
    MUST  `open the dismissal procedure formally, in writing`
    HENCE (PARTY `the school principal` MUST `give the teacher the full record of the second meeting`)

-- Stage ב(3): the goals of improvement are set again, and an examination
-- period "של 3 עד 4 חודשים" — both ends in, the text giving the range (an
-- exception to convention thresholds.until, as §22(ד)'s "3 עד 6"); the
-- principal sets out to the teacher what he will go through in it.
@ref akn:att_13__hc_1__para_c__hc_2__subpara_3
GIVEN `months of the examination period set` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the examination period is within stage ב's range` `months of the examination period set` IF
    `months of the examination period set` AT LEAST 3 AND `months of the examination period set` AT MOST 4

`setting the examination period` MEANS
    PARTY `the school principal`
    MUST  `set the goals again, and an examination period`

§§ `ג. הליך הפיטורים — שלב ג'`

-- Stage ג(1): in the examination period three professional visits at least
-- are made in the teacher's lessons ("לפחות": 3 are in), three weeks apart
-- at least ("לפחות": 21 days are in), coordinated by the Ministry's
-- supervisor of the school.
@ref akn:att_13__hc_1__para_c__hc_3__subpara_1
`coordinating the visits` MEANS
    PARTY `the supervisor`
    MUST  `coordinate the professional visits`

-- Stage ג(2): the visits are made in this order: (2.1) the school
-- principal, in one lesson at least; (2.2) the coordinator of the subject
-- the teacher teaches, in one lesson at least — chosen from a pool of
-- coordinators the Ministry draws up in coordination with the
-- organisation, or, with none, a fitting professional the head of the
-- subject at the Ministry appoints, and never a coordinator from the
-- teacher's own school; (2.3) the Ministry's professional supervisor of
-- the subject, in one lesson at least — or, with none, a fitting
-- professional the head of the subject appoints, who may visit himself in
-- the supervisor's place.
@ref akn:att_13__hc_1__para_c__hc_3__subpara_2 akn:att_13__hc_1__para_c__hc_3__subpara_2__cls_2-1 akn:att_13__hc_1__para_c__hc_3__subpara_2__cls_2-2 akn:att_13__hc_1__para_c__hc_3__subpara_2__cls_2-2/p2 akn:att_13__hc_1__para_c__hc_3__subpara_2__cls_2-2/p4 akn:att_13__hc_1__para_c__hc_3__subpara_2__cls_2-3
`the visits stage ג makes, in order` MEANS
    LIST `the school principal`, `the subject coordinator`, `the professional supervisor of the subject`

@desc A visit stage ג makes in a lesson of the teacher's.
DECLARE `Oz annex ה visit` HAS
    `the visitor`                       IS A Party @desc the principal, the subject coordinator or the professional supervisor, or one in his place
    `lessons visited`                   IS A NUMBER
    `days since the visit before`       IS A NUMBER @desc from the visit before it; for the first, any number
    `a coordinator from the teacher's own school` IS A BOOLEAN

GIVEN visits IS A LIST OF `Oz annex ה visit`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `stage ג's visits are made as annex ה sets them` visits IF
        count visits AT LEAST 3
    AND map (GIVEN v YIELD v's `the visitor`) (take 3 visits) EQUALS `the visits stage ג makes, in order`
    AND all (GIVEN v YIELD v's `lessons visited` AT LEAST 1) visits
    AND all (GIVEN v YIELD v's `days since the visit before` AT LEAST 21) (drop 1 visits)
    AND all (GIVEN v YIELD NOT v's `a coordinator from the teacher's own school`) visits

-- At the end of each visit the visitor holds a feedback talk with the
-- teacher, and within a week of the visit (7 days, the seventh in:
-- convention dates.end) writes a detailed opinion of its findings with an
-- explicit recommendation; the opinions go to the school's supervisor and
-- the principal, and a copy of each to the teacher, by the visitor or the
-- principal, soon after the visit.
@ref akn:att_13__hc_1__para_c__hc_3__subpara_2/p2 akn:att_13__hc_1__para_c__hc_3__subpara_2/p3
`days for the visitor's opinion` MEANS 7

GIVEN visitor IS A Party
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `Oz annex ה action`
DECIDE `reporting on the visit by` visitor IS
    PARTY visitor
    MUST  `hold a feedback talk after the visit`
    HENCE (PARTY visitor
           MUST  `write a detailed opinion with an explicit recommendation`
           WITHIN `days for the visitor's opinion`
           HENCE (PARTY visitor MUST `give the opinion to the supervisor and the principal, and a copy to the teacher`)
           LEST  BREACH BY visitor BECAUSE "נספח ה', ג. שלב ג'(2): the opinion is written within a week of the visit")

-- akn:att_13__hc_1__para_c__hc_3__subpara_2__cls_2-2/p3 The signatures at the foot of the page, in the middle of 2.2; no rule.

§§ `ג. הליך הפיטורים — שלב ד'`

-- Stage ד(1): the school's supervisor writes a summary report of the
-- procedure the teacher went through, with his explicit recommendation
-- whether, on the material before him, the teacher's dismissal is to be
-- considered ("the summary report").
@ref akn:att_13__hc_1__para_c__hc_4__subpara_1
`writing the summary report` MEANS
    PARTY `the supervisor`
    MUST  `write the summary report with an explicit recommendation`

-- Stage ד(2)–(3): where the supervisor decides the material warrants
-- considering the dismissal, he sends a copy of the report to the owner's
-- director-general and to the district's manager or supervisor; where he
-- recommends it, the owner summons the teacher to a hearing before it
-- decides on his dismissal, and the organisation's representative too.
@ref akn:att_13__hc_1__para_c__hc_4__subpara_2 akn:att_13__hc_1__para_c__hc_4__subpara_3
GIVEN `the supervisor recommends considering the dismissal` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `Oz annex ה action`
DECIDE `what stage ד asks once the report is written` `the supervisor recommends considering the dismissal` IS
    IF `the supervisor recommends considering the dismissal`
    THEN PARTY `the supervisor`
         MUST  `send the summary report to the owner's director-general and the district`
         HENCE (PARTY `the local authority or owning body` MUST `summon the teacher and the organisation's representative to a hearing`)
    ELSE FULFILLED

-- Stage ד(4): the power to dismiss is the owner's competent organ's or
-- organs', by the law that applies to it.
@ref akn:att_13__hc_1__para_c__hc_4__subpara_4
`why who may dismiss is not here` MEANS
    `set elsewhere` "הגורם או הגורמים המוסמכים של הבעלות, על פי הוראות הדין החל עליה"

-- Stage ד(5): if the dismissal is decided, the owner's manager, or one he
-- empowers, tells the teacher of it in writing by 31.5 of that school year
-- (school year y ends 31.8.(y+1); its 31.5 is in y+1; the day included,
-- convention dates.end). A notice after it is not this procedure's.
@ref akn:att_13__hc_1__para_c__hc_4__subpara_5
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER @desc the school year the procedure begins in, by the calendar year it opens in
GIVETH A DATE
DECIDE `the last day for the notice of dismissal in` y IS
    DATE_FROM_DMY 31 5 (y PLUS 1)

GIVEN y IS A NUMBER, `the day of the notice` IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the notice of dismissal is in time for` y `the day of the notice` IF
    `the day of the notice` `is on or before` `the last day for the notice of dismissal in` y

GIVEN `days from the decision to that day` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `Oz annex ה action`
DECIDE `giving the notice of dismissal` `days from the decision to that day` IS
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body`
    MUST  `give the teacher written notice of his dismissal`
    WITHIN `days from the decision to that day`
    LEST  BREACH BY `the local authority or owning body` BECAUSE "נספח ה', ג. שלב ד'(5): the notice of dismissal is given in writing by 31.5 of the school year"

§§ `ג. הליך הפיטורים — הערות`

-- Note 1: a dismissal for a pedagogical reason does not take away the
-- teaching licence. Note "5." (the corpus marks the numbering's jump from
-- 1 to 5): it is a dismissal from the owner that employed the teacher
-- only, and does not bar his being employed in teaching by another owner.
@ref akn:att_13__hc_1__para_c__hc_5__subpara_1 akn:att_13__hc_1__para_c__hc_5__subpara_5
`a pedagogical dismissal takes away the teaching licence` MEANS FALSE

`a pedagogical dismissal bars teaching for another owner` MEANS FALSE

-- Note 6: the teacher is told of each visit's day by the principal or the
-- school's supervisor 24 hours in advance at least (one day; "לכל הפחות":
-- it is in).
@ref akn:att_13__hc_1__para_c__hc_5__subpara_6
`hours of notice of a visit, at least` MEANS 24

GIVEN `hours of notice given` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the teacher was told of the visit in time` `hours of notice given` IF
    `hours of notice given` AT LEAST `hours of notice of a visit, at least`

GIVEN `the principal or the school's supervisor` IS A Party
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `Oz annex ה action`
DECIDE `telling the teacher of a visit by` `the principal or the school's supervisor` IS
    PARTY `the principal or the school's supervisor`
    MUST  `tell the teacher of a visit`

-- Notes 7–8: a teacher who brings a sick note for a visit's day is given
-- another day, again 24 hours in advance; if the visit on that day does
-- not take place for reasons that depend on the teacher, the other day
-- counts as a visit for every purpose. A teacher who refuses to let a
-- lesson be visited is as if the visit was made and its opinion negative.
@ref akn:att_13__hc_1__para_c__hc_5__subpara_7 akn:att_13__hc_1__para_c__hc_5__subpara_8
DECLARE `what became of an annex ה visit` IS ONE OF
    `the visit was made`
    `the teacher brought a sick note for its day`
    `on the other day, it did not take place for reasons that depend on the teacher`
    `on the other day, it did not take place for another reason`
    `the teacher refused the visit`

GIVEN what IS A `what became of an annex ה visit`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `it counts as a visit` what IF
    CONSIDER what
    WHEN `the visit was made` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `the teacher brought a sick note for its day` THEN FALSE
    WHEN `on the other day, it did not take place for reasons that depend on the teacher` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `on the other day, it did not take place for another reason` THEN FALSE
    WHEN `the teacher refused the visit` THEN TRUE

GIVEN what IS A `what became of an annex ה visit`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `it counts as a negative opinion` what IF
    what EQUALS `the teacher refused the visit`

GIVEN what IS A `what became of an annex ה visit`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `another day is set for the visit` what IF
    what EQUALS `the teacher brought a sick note for its day`

-- Note 9: the procedure was shaped with the organisation, and every change
-- in it is made in coordination with it.
@ref akn:att_13__hc_1__para_c__hc_5__subpara_9
`changing the procedure` MEANS
    PARTY `the Ministry of Education`
    MUST  `coordinate a change in the procedure with the organisation`

-- akn:att_13__hc_1__para_c__hc_5__subpara_9/p2 The signatures; no rule.

§§ `נספח ה' -- illustrations`

-- The accompaniment year from 1.9.2012: the teacher is told of the faults
-- by 31.8.2012; the summary is due by 31.8.2013, 364 days from the year's
-- opening; a procedure that begins in the school year from 1.9.2013 has
-- its stage א meeting by 1.10.2013 and its notice of dismissal by
-- 31.5.2014.
#ASSERT `the day by which the teacher is told of the faults before` 2012 EQUALS DATE_FROM_DMY 31 8 2012
#ASSERT `days the principal has for the summary in` 2012 EQUALS 364
#ASSERT `the school year the dismissal procedure begins in` 2012 8 TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST 2013
#ASSERT `the school year the dismissal procedure begins in` 2012 7.5 TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `the last day for the stage א meeting in` 2013 EQUALS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 10 2013
#ASSERT `the notice of dismissal is in time for` 2013 (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 5 2014)
#ASSERT NOT `the notice of dismissal is in time for` 2013 (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 6 2014)
#ASSERT `the second meeting is summoned and held in time` 7 4 AND `the second meeting is summoned and held in time` 10 6
#ASSERT NOT `the second meeting is summoned and held in time` 6 5
#ASSERT NOT `the second meeting is summoned and held in time` 7 7
#ASSERT `the examination period is within stage ב's range` 3 AND `the examination period is within stage ב's range` 4
#ASSERT NOT `the examination period is within stage ב's range` 5
-- Three visits in the order stage ג sets, three weeks apart and more,
-- make it; the coordinator first does not.
GIVEN visitor IS A Party, lessons IS A NUMBER, days IS A NUMBER
GIVETH AN `Oz annex ה visit`
DECIDE `an annex ה visit` visitor lessons days IS
    `Oz annex ה visit` WITH
        `the visitor`                                 IS visitor
